    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d46">

                <pb facs="0125" n="33" xml:id="pg33"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt
                    Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Marshal Stalin to President Roosevelt</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d46-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-10-17">October 17, 1943</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Personal and secret message from Premier J. V.
                        Stalin to President Franklin D.
                        Roosevelt</p>
                <p>I have received both of your messages of October 14.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d46-f2"
                    /> I thank you for the information about the Secretary of State and his staff,
                    who are on their way now. I hope they will soon arrive safely in Moscow.</p>
                <p>I shall send my reply regarding the question raised in your second message, after
                    I have counsel with my colleagues in the Government.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">October</hi> 17, 1943.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d46-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d46-f1-content">
